---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="About | UnsaidSignals"
  description="Our mission is to help leaders understand team dynamics early and act with clarity before problems escalate."
  canonical="/about"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100">About UnsaidSignals</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-zinc-300">
      We built UnsaidSignals after watching high-performing teams lose momentum because leaders only had lagging indicators.
      Output metrics looked fine until they did not.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-zinc-300">
      Our mission is to make team health measurable, actionable, and continuous by turning small weekly signals into practical narratives.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Our Story</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-300">Created for leaders who want to prevent burnout, drift, and coordination debt before they harden into outcomes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Our Team</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-300">A cross-functional group of operators, product builders, and engineering leaders focused on organizational clarity.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-6 md:col-span-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-300">Help every team leader understand what is unsaid, respond earlier, and build healthier organizations that sustain performance.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
